Command:        Scan
Purpose:        Display item numbers and item titles
Available at:   Message and Upload area subboard prompts

Scan will display a list of the available items.  By default, the Scan command will begin at the last item that was used in any way (read, scanned, etc).  To begin scanning at a particular item number, use something like S7-.

Popular variations of the Scan command include:

                SN              Scan New items
                SA              Scan Global New items (all subboards)
                S 'text'        Scan items with 'text' in their titles or
                                short descriptions.

